Scope of this license

This MIT license covers the analysis code, the figure- and number-generation
pipelines, the test suite, and the documentation in this repository.

It does NOT cover, and the following are governed by their own terms:

  * Gravitational-wave parameter-estimation data. Not redistributed in this
    repository. These are public releases from the Gravitational Wave Open
    Science Center, distributed under a Creative Commons Attribution licence;
    see docs/DATA_AVAILABILITY.md for record numbers and terms.

  * The manuscript (paper/manuscript.tex, paper/manuscript.pdf). Provided for
    transparency and reproducibility. Copyright of the manuscript text and
    figures remains with the author; it is intended for journal publication and
    is not placed in the public domain by this license.
